{"unit_id":"atesahmet0__dh-workspace#card-zh","repo":"atesahmet0/dh-workspace","commit":"037797a85533d9b8398e55e19c9f5f2cd6810962","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dh-multiagents 为 DSH 提供多代理协作工作流，适用于 Web 和 TUI。bundle 接入计划读写、委派及 Git worktree 工具，并提供 plan、build、explore、researcher、coder、scribe、reviewer 等角色。用户可保存项目计划，将探索、研究、编码、文档和审查交给对应代理，也能隔离并行改动。启动时会镜像预设和技能到 DSH 用户目录。适合需要协调代理完成开发任务的用户；需要 DeepSeek API 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:67-82","packages/dh-workspace/src/index.ts:209-280","packages/dh-delegation/src/index.ts:1-25","packages/dh-worktree/src/index.ts:206-314"]}
